WEBVTT

01:24.960 --> 01:27.000
ADAPTED FROM THE LEGEND
OF KUNSHAN JADE BY TAN TIANYIN

01:50.560 --> 01:53.120
Shrimp was like a brother to Duanwu.

01:53.200 --> 01:54.360
Loud,

01:55.640 --> 01:57.760
Cao Da, and Wei Yan

01:59.280 --> 02:01.000
were her best friends

02:01.600 --> 02:02.640
after she fled to Hepu.

02:05.960 --> 02:07.920
They were like my family.

02:10.960 --> 02:12.480
But they died because of me.

02:13.360 --> 02:15.120
You took care of their funerals

02:15.200 --> 02:16.720
and comforted their families.

02:17.720 --> 02:19.080
It was not you who killed them.

02:19.880 --> 02:21.000
It was the Black Dragon Bandits.

02:24.400 --> 02:25.720
But they are dead.

02:27.880 --> 02:29.760
Even if I give their family more pensions,

02:31.560 --> 02:33.440
I can't make it up to them.

02:36.320 --> 02:37.480
It has already happened.

02:38.920 --> 02:40.480
It's useless

02:40.560 --> 02:41.640
to indulge in sadness.

02:42.280 --> 02:44.360
I believe Duanwu suffered more pain

02:46.120 --> 02:47.120
than I did.

02:52.000 --> 02:55.320
Time heals all wounds.

03:03.600 --> 03:04.640
Maybe.

04:12.920 --> 04:15.080
I was looking for Supervisor Kang
to send it to you.

04:16.079 --> 04:17.320
Take the medicine.

04:20.279 --> 04:21.200
Thank you.

04:32.240 --> 04:33.200
Isn't it hot?

04:34.520 --> 04:35.400
No.

04:37.080 --> 04:37.920
Well…

04:38.440 --> 04:39.600
Thank you
for taking care of me these days.

04:41.040 --> 04:42.920
When I'm healed,
I'll leave Clear Mind right away.

04:45.960 --> 04:47.120
Just get better here.

04:49.080 --> 04:50.240
I'll make you noodle soup.

05:43.000 --> 05:43.840
It's delicious.

05:44.840 --> 05:45.720
Thank you.

05:54.880 --> 05:56.160
Have you ever thought

05:59.320 --> 06:01.800
about what would happen to them

06:02.440 --> 06:03.480
if you disappeared in Yangzhou?

06:05.840 --> 06:07.080
What do you mean?

06:14.120 --> 06:15.760
I am willing to be your ally

06:16.840 --> 06:17.760
rather than your enemy.

06:20.520 --> 06:21.840
Do you mean

06:24.640 --> 06:25.720
that I can stay at Clear Mind?

06:30.320 --> 06:31.440
Just eat it.

06:46.440 --> 06:49.120
No one has made you noodles for years.

07:13.640 --> 07:16.080
Mr. Zheng. I invited you here

07:16.760 --> 07:18.880
to explain ourselves to you.

07:20.360 --> 07:21.200
Lady Bai

07:21.280 --> 07:23.680
went to the Governor's Office to admit
that she had made false accusations

07:23.760 --> 07:26.080
because she was threatened by Yan Zijing.

07:29.480 --> 07:30.760
How did Yan Zijing

07:33.320 --> 07:34.520
threaten you?

07:35.800 --> 07:36.640
Yan Zijing realized

07:36.720 --> 07:39.200
that Lady Bai and Baicaojing House
were working together.

07:39.280 --> 07:41.000
He wanted to discredit me.

07:41.600 --> 07:45.440
-Lady Bai had no choice…
-Lady Bai, speaking of that,

07:47.040 --> 07:48.720
I must toast you.

07:48.800 --> 07:50.160
Thank you for proving my innocence.

07:50.240 --> 07:52.280
Yes. Cheers.

07:57.480 --> 07:59.200
But I'm not interested

07:59.720 --> 08:02.840
in dealing with your matter.

08:02.920 --> 08:04.320
Mr. Zheng,

08:04.400 --> 08:05.320
Lady Huan is dead.

08:05.400 --> 08:07.920
Lady Bai will definitely
win the top beauty title next year.

08:08.480 --> 08:09.960
Baicaojing House
will do our best to support her.

08:10.040 --> 08:13.560
Baicaojing House has long
since lost its reputation.

08:13.640 --> 08:15.080
Mr. Qin.

08:16.640 --> 08:18.160
Are you not self-aware?

08:21.080 --> 08:24.440
Mr. Zheng, I was an underdog

08:24.520 --> 08:26.000
before I won my first top beauty title.

08:26.560 --> 08:27.880
But I won it.

08:27.960 --> 08:32.440
Baicaojing House is famous in Yangzhou.

08:32.520 --> 08:34.159
We just have to start all over again.

08:42.440 --> 08:44.120
Lady Bai,

08:44.840 --> 08:45.840
I wish you all the best.

08:45.920 --> 08:47.320
Garuda.

08:48.800 --> 08:50.080
I don't like the wine here.

08:51.320 --> 08:52.400
Let's go to another wine shop.

08:53.160 --> 08:54.080
Mr. Zheng.

08:55.960 --> 08:57.040
Walk them out.

09:01.800 --> 09:03.080
What did I say?

09:03.160 --> 09:05.560
We should please him.

09:05.640 --> 09:07.200
But you got on a high horse.

09:09.000 --> 09:10.680
The Zheng family is also a merchant.

09:10.760 --> 09:13.120
Will they give their customers to you?

09:15.800 --> 09:17.560
Maybe he could make a guild director.

09:17.640 --> 09:19.800
Are you qualified, Mu?

09:19.880 --> 09:22.400
I'm satisfied

09:22.480 --> 09:23.960
that we own Baicaojing House

09:24.040 --> 09:25.200
in Yangzhou.

09:26.080 --> 09:28.320
Just take care of the shop.

09:30.840 --> 09:32.920
You saw his attitude.

09:33.000 --> 09:35.440
He looked down on our Baicaojing House.

09:35.520 --> 09:37.800
It doesn't matter.

09:37.880 --> 09:39.600
It would be nice if he likes you.

09:39.680 --> 09:40.600
Si is dead.

09:40.680 --> 09:42.880
Wu will be the master of the Zheng family.

09:44.640 --> 09:45.640
Niao.

09:46.280 --> 09:47.840
If you marry the Zheng family,

09:48.600 --> 09:50.480
I will be
the Zheng family's brother-in-law.

09:50.560 --> 09:51.760
Will Xu Nanying

09:52.440 --> 09:53.360
make you his concubine?

09:53.960 --> 09:56.240
You can't be his concubine. You're like…

09:57.000 --> 09:57.960
Like what?

09:58.920 --> 09:59.880
Like a whore?

09:59.960 --> 10:02.920
No, that's not what I meant.

10:03.000 --> 10:05.720
Niao. You have to think for yourself.

10:06.680 --> 10:08.080
I'm doing it for your own good.

10:16.320 --> 10:17.880
Why did you come back so late?

10:17.960 --> 10:20.280
Where is Garuda? Why isn't he holding you?

10:20.360 --> 10:21.920
He's not holding me.

10:23.320 --> 10:26.240
You'll be happy if I fall to my death.

10:27.320 --> 10:29.280
You're with me

10:29.360 --> 10:32.040
to kill Yan Zijing.

10:34.160 --> 10:35.320
What are you talking about?

10:36.920 --> 10:38.080
-Stop drinking.
-Leave me alone.

10:57.680 --> 10:58.520
Okay.

11:00.840 --> 11:02.000
Lady Shijiu.

11:02.600 --> 11:03.720
You've endured humiliation

11:03.800 --> 11:05.800
for so long.

11:05.880 --> 11:07.840
You suffered.

11:11.760 --> 11:15.440
I didn't kill Yan Zijing.

11:15.520 --> 11:17.560
You must be disappointed in me.

11:17.640 --> 11:19.960
I'm not the heir of the Zheng family.

11:20.600 --> 11:22.800
I'm useless.

11:22.880 --> 11:24.640
I'm a useless concubine's son.

11:24.720 --> 11:27.760
I'm not good enough for you,
Lady Shijiu of the Cui family.

11:36.760 --> 11:37.720
Cui Shijiu.

11:38.640 --> 11:39.800
Cui Shijiu.

11:41.440 --> 11:44.000
Let me ask you something. Do you hate me

11:44.680 --> 11:47.480
for stopping you from going to Chang'an?

11:48.280 --> 11:52.200
There are many dignitaries in Chang'an.

11:52.280 --> 11:53.320
As long as you give yourself to them…

11:53.920 --> 11:55.160
As long as you give yourself to them,

11:55.240 --> 11:57.960
they will kill Yan Zijing for you.

12:00.480 --> 12:01.400
Yeah.

12:02.320 --> 12:04.640
It's too late for you
to go to Chang'an now.

12:07.080 --> 12:08.400
The door is right there.

12:10.760 --> 12:11.800
You can leave whenever you want.

12:13.000 --> 12:14.440
I won't stop you.

12:15.800 --> 12:16.800
Zheng Zhiheng.

12:19.000 --> 12:20.560
What do you make of me?

12:27.760 --> 12:30.640
My father is lying to me.

12:32.840 --> 12:35.880
Su Muzhe

12:37.840 --> 12:38.720
is lying to me.

12:40.480 --> 12:44.640
Why are you also lying to me, Cui Shijiu?

14:58.920 --> 15:00.280
Su Muzhe, come out.

15:00.360 --> 15:02.880
CLEAR MIND

15:10.600 --> 15:11.600
Let's talk outside.

15:12.200 --> 15:13.800
The ten-day deadline is up.

15:13.880 --> 15:15.360
We're here to get our money.

15:17.480 --> 15:20.200
It's not easy for us
to make money for retirement.

15:21.280 --> 15:22.120
I'm sorry.

15:22.200 --> 15:23.440
You can withdraw your money.

15:24.320 --> 15:27.000
But Clear Mind has no money right now.

15:27.080 --> 15:29.080
We had a deal.

15:29.160 --> 15:30.760
There has always been a deadline
for withdrawal.

15:31.360 --> 15:32.240
You withdrew without warning.

15:32.320 --> 15:34.800
And this is Clear Mind's
most difficult period.

15:34.880 --> 15:36.440
We don't want to talk to you.

15:36.520 --> 15:37.680
Where is Ms. Su?

15:37.760 --> 15:38.600
Call her out.

15:38.680 --> 15:40.520
Su Muzhe, come out.

15:40.600 --> 15:42.080
Let us talk to Ms. Su.

15:42.160 --> 15:43.840
-Su Muzhe, come out.
-Keep it down.

15:43.920 --> 15:45.120
-Come out.
-Come out.

15:45.200 --> 15:46.520
-Su Muzhe.
-Ms. Su, come out.

15:46.600 --> 15:47.440
Shiqi.

15:51.440 --> 15:52.560
I'm sorry.

15:54.240 --> 15:55.200
I'm sorry.

15:57.120 --> 15:58.200
I know

15:58.800 --> 16:00.080
the deadline is up.

16:02.080 --> 16:03.640
But Clear Mind is out of money.

16:04.680 --> 16:07.000
We have some mother-of-pearl jewelry left.

16:07.600 --> 16:09.000
If you don't mind,

16:09.080 --> 16:10.080
you can take them all.

16:10.160 --> 16:12.440
Here are the IOUs.

16:14.080 --> 16:15.080
Verbal statements are no guarantee.

16:16.440 --> 16:18.800
I'll repay you every three months.

16:18.880 --> 16:21.200
I'll pay you off in six months.
The interest is 3%.

16:22.360 --> 16:23.640
I won't let you suffer losses.

16:24.560 --> 16:25.800
If you want the money now,

16:26.920 --> 16:27.760
I'm sorry,

16:28.280 --> 16:29.320
I don't have it.

16:37.920 --> 16:40.720
Now that Clear Mind can't come up
with the money,

16:40.800 --> 16:43.080
let's give Ms. Su

16:43.160 --> 16:44.320
some more time.

16:44.880 --> 16:47.240
Ms. Su won't break her words.

16:51.520 --> 16:52.360
Ms. Su.

16:52.440 --> 16:55.760
Show us the withdrawal document
and IOUs. We'll sign it.

16:56.360 --> 16:57.800
There's no other way.

16:57.880 --> 16:58.720
Ms. Su.

16:58.800 --> 17:01.200
Please keep your promise.

17:02.480 --> 17:03.480
I will.

17:07.240 --> 17:08.560
Thank you.

17:13.960 --> 17:16.319
Here's your withdrawal document and IOUs.

17:19.680 --> 17:20.520
SIGNATURE

17:37.320 --> 17:38.760
-Duanwu.
-Ms. Su.

17:39.440 --> 17:43.240
-The goods are arriving. Come and unload.
-Ms. Su.

17:43.320 --> 17:44.320
-Lady Wu from Guangzhou
-The goods have arrived.

17:44.400 --> 17:46.440
lend us a lot of gold and raw stones.

17:46.520 --> 17:48.880
We don't have to worry about it.

17:48.960 --> 17:51.000
Ladies, don't withdraw.

17:55.200 --> 17:56.080
Careful.

17:57.920 --> 17:59.560
Ms. Su, get more people.

17:59.640 --> 18:01.520
There are a lot of goods here.
I can't unload everything myself.

18:01.600 --> 18:02.600
-Yunxiu.
-Lady Xue.

18:02.680 --> 18:03.720
Yingtao.

18:03.800 --> 18:04.720
What's going on?

18:04.800 --> 18:07.080
These are all our raw materials.

18:07.640 --> 18:09.920
Look. All these boxes.

18:10.000 --> 18:11.360
There are many in the back.

18:11.440 --> 18:13.080
You won't believe

18:14.760 --> 18:16.080
it's a coincidence.

18:17.840 --> 18:18.760
Ladies,

18:19.920 --> 18:21.480
you've signed IOUs.

18:22.160 --> 18:23.680
It's settled.

18:24.800 --> 18:27.200
I don't know

18:27.280 --> 18:28.520
what will happen to Clear Mind.

18:29.520 --> 18:30.600
From now on,

18:30.680 --> 18:32.280
you don't have to worry about Clear Mind.

18:32.360 --> 18:34.400
We'll repay you on time.

18:35.160 --> 18:36.040
Thank you.

18:36.640 --> 18:38.520
-Wait, Ms. Su…
-Stop it.

18:39.120 --> 18:40.680
We wanted to withdraw.

18:40.760 --> 18:42.120
We shouldn't talk about it.

18:42.200 --> 18:43.480
Ms. Su didn't treat us badly.

18:43.560 --> 18:44.560
-Come on, Yingtao.
-Come on.

18:45.440 --> 18:47.280
-Let me.
-Let's get out of here.

18:48.000 --> 18:50.200
-Yingtao.
-Yeah. Let me.

18:52.840 --> 18:55.160
Ms. Su, here's a letter from Lady Wu.

18:56.960 --> 18:58.000
Hurry.

19:00.560 --> 19:02.160
She asked me to bring all the money back.

19:06.640 --> 19:07.520
Duanwu.

19:08.040 --> 19:09.160
I hope this letter finds you well.

19:10.360 --> 19:11.600
I heard Clear Mind is having difficulties.

19:12.120 --> 19:13.440
I'm worried.

19:13.520 --> 19:15.640
Here are gold and raw stones.

19:15.720 --> 19:17.160
I hope this helps you.

19:17.880 --> 19:18.800
As for the money,

19:18.880 --> 19:20.320
don't worry about it.

19:22.320 --> 19:23.280
You said

19:24.040 --> 19:25.880
gold always shines.

20:00.080 --> 20:03.240
ONYX STONES FROM SIJIAO MOUNTAIN

20:13.560 --> 20:14.680
Are you going to make glass?

20:15.400 --> 20:16.360
Yes.

20:19.520 --> 20:21.680
But I didn't find out

20:23.240 --> 20:25.960
the specific process

20:26.040 --> 20:26.880
of making glass,

20:27.480 --> 20:28.560
not to mention the ratios.

20:29.800 --> 20:30.880
If there are no ratios,

20:32.360 --> 20:33.520
I can't make glass.

20:35.000 --> 20:36.000
Take it easy.

20:37.120 --> 20:38.960
If everyone knows how to make it,

20:39.520 --> 20:41.200
it won't be Clear Mind's featured product.

20:49.640 --> 20:50.480
You're right.

20:52.880 --> 20:53.960
I'm rushing.

20:56.080 --> 20:56.960
Look.

20:58.160 --> 20:59.200
I'll copy down the contents

20:59.280 --> 21:01.240
of these books for you.

21:04.480 --> 21:06.440
Don't you have some work to do?

21:07.480 --> 21:08.640
I don't have work to do today.

21:10.600 --> 21:11.920
Then, thank you.

21:17.280 --> 21:18.320
Zhang Jinran.

21:19.000 --> 21:21.640
You're idle as an inspector.

21:22.480 --> 21:23.880
I happened to have no work today.

21:23.960 --> 21:25.080
Duanwu just said the same thing.

21:27.760 --> 21:28.600
What are you doing?

21:29.720 --> 21:30.800
Do you want to make glass?

21:31.400 --> 21:33.320
Clear Mind has no foundation.

21:34.040 --> 21:36.440
Maybe I can gain a foothold
by making glass.

21:37.720 --> 21:38.960
You know

21:39.040 --> 21:40.520
the Zheng family is in the glass business.

21:41.280 --> 21:43.000
Are you going against the Zheng family?

21:43.080 --> 21:44.000
I know.

21:45.320 --> 21:48.640
The Zheng family makes Persian glassware.

21:49.600 --> 21:51.520
I want to make Clear Mind glass.

21:52.280 --> 21:53.120
It's different.

21:59.520 --> 22:00.680
What are you drawing?

22:00.760 --> 22:02.080
I'm copying down the contents

22:02.160 --> 22:03.880
of these books for Duanwu.

22:05.320 --> 22:06.680
It's wrong.

22:10.200 --> 22:11.040
It's right.

22:12.080 --> 22:13.600
Master Yan.

22:13.680 --> 22:15.240
I've been drawing
since I was three years old.

22:15.320 --> 22:16.440
What's wrong with my painting?

22:16.520 --> 22:18.160
It doesn't matter
when you started drawing.

22:18.240 --> 22:19.440
The drawing scale is wrong.

22:20.160 --> 22:21.280
There's a stool there.

22:21.800 --> 22:23.480
-Come on. Get up.
-You…

22:31.280 --> 22:33.440
The ratio of a kiln to its entrance
is important.

22:33.520 --> 22:36.080
The change in the ratio
will affect the heat

22:36.160 --> 22:37.680
and, thus, the finished product.

23:05.400 --> 23:07.760
Today's incense is a little choking.

23:12.240 --> 23:14.120
If I want to make this kiln,

23:15.280 --> 23:16.240
how long will it take?

23:17.480 --> 23:18.320
First…

23:20.000 --> 23:21.840
Are you done? Do you need to see a doctor?

23:23.160 --> 23:25.400
I'm all right. Go on.

23:29.040 --> 23:30.200
It's not easy

23:30.960 --> 23:31.920
to make a new kiln.

23:32.680 --> 23:34.640
You need to find

23:34.720 --> 23:35.560
some professional craftsmen…

23:40.200 --> 23:41.400
Mr. Zhang, do you need some water?

23:42.200 --> 23:44.480
It's okay. I'll move it outside.

23:50.920 --> 23:52.240
Where were we?

23:52.960 --> 23:53.920
You can

23:54.000 --> 23:55.240
make a new kiln.

23:55.320 --> 23:57.320
But you need to find
some professional craftsmen.

23:58.000 --> 23:59.280
It took your father

23:59.360 --> 24:01.000
a few years

24:01.080 --> 24:03.040
to make the colorful glass.

24:04.000 --> 24:05.560
You have the formula,

24:05.640 --> 24:07.360
but you don't know the ratios, heat,

24:08.200 --> 24:10.000
or a kiln.

24:10.080 --> 24:14.080
And you need a lot of professional
laborers and craftsmen.

24:15.000 --> 24:16.080
You need to do it step by step.

24:18.800 --> 24:19.640
Well.

24:20.160 --> 24:22.640
There was Qin's Glass Workshop
in Yangzhou.

24:23.400 --> 24:25.480
I heard that Mr. Qin is still in Yangzhou.

24:26.040 --> 24:27.840
I've sent Yingtao to ask around.

24:28.480 --> 24:29.840
I'll hear from her soon.

24:29.920 --> 24:31.000
It's a good start

24:31.840 --> 24:33.120
if you can find him.

24:34.160 --> 24:35.000
Yes.

24:41.640 --> 24:42.480
Zhang Jinran.

24:43.120 --> 24:44.240
Well.

24:44.320 --> 24:45.240
Are you hungry?

24:46.000 --> 24:47.000
I'm not hungry.

24:47.520 --> 24:48.520
If you're hungry, you can eat first.

24:49.120 --> 24:50.720
I'm busy.

24:50.800 --> 24:51.880
Duanwu hasn't eaten yet.

24:52.720 --> 24:55.080
Why don't you go to the kitchen
and cook something?

24:57.000 --> 24:58.360
I want to go.

24:59.440 --> 25:01.080
But I can't cook.

25:01.160 --> 25:02.680
Du Ming usually cooks for me.

25:02.760 --> 25:03.880
That's great.

25:04.520 --> 25:06.560
It's never too late to learn.

25:06.640 --> 25:08.200
You can take this opportunity
to learn to cook.

25:10.160 --> 25:12.160
Is there someone in the kitchen?

25:13.520 --> 25:14.640
Kang Ju is there.

25:14.720 --> 25:15.640
Maybe you should go.

25:15.720 --> 25:17.280
You go. I'm busy.

25:17.360 --> 25:19.120
-You go.
-Go.

25:19.200 --> 25:21.320
-You go.
-I'm talking with Duanwu. You go.

25:21.400 --> 25:22.440
-You…
-I'll go.

25:23.040 --> 25:25.800
I'll go. I'll go.

25:25.880 --> 25:28.840
ZHENLANG PAVILION

25:28.920 --> 25:31.480
CLEAR MIND

25:31.560 --> 25:33.640
Ms. Su, we found him.

25:34.440 --> 25:35.440
Ms. Su,

25:35.520 --> 25:36.480
we found him.

25:38.560 --> 25:39.520
I…

25:39.600 --> 25:40.560
Ms. Su,

25:40.640 --> 25:41.480
we found him.

25:42.000 --> 25:43.400
Ten years ago,

25:43.480 --> 25:45.000
a man named Qin

25:45.080 --> 25:47.280
opened Qin's Glass Workshop in Yangzhou.

25:47.880 --> 25:49.800
But they couldn't

25:49.880 --> 25:51.200
sell anything.

25:52.920 --> 25:54.680
-They were suppressed by…
-The Zhengs.

25:54.760 --> 25:55.720
-The Zhengs.
-The Zhengs.

25:55.800 --> 25:56.880
They were suppressed by the Zheng family.

25:56.960 --> 25:59.440
Qin ended up with a lot of debt,
and his wife was gone.

25:59.520 --> 26:01.160
But his children were left.
It's a silver lining.

26:01.240 --> 26:03.440
Did they make their glass themselves?

26:03.520 --> 26:04.360
Yes.

26:04.440 --> 26:06.280
Mr. Qin studied in Persia for ten years.

26:06.360 --> 26:07.320
Yes.

26:09.160 --> 26:10.840
Go. Lead the way.

26:10.920 --> 26:11.800
-Okay.
-Okay, let's go.

26:14.800 --> 26:16.200
Ms. Su, here we are.

26:17.360 --> 26:19.160
Mr. Qin is cranky.

26:21.360 --> 26:22.400
Mr. Qin.

26:27.800 --> 26:30.200
GLASS VASE

26:31.480 --> 26:32.480
Nice to meet you, Mr. Qin.

26:33.000 --> 26:37.800
I don't have much goods here.

26:37.880 --> 26:40.960
If you want to buy glass,

26:41.040 --> 26:44.080
go to another shop.

26:47.280 --> 26:50.920
Who are you?

26:51.000 --> 26:53.120
She's the owner of Clear Mind,

26:53.200 --> 26:54.600
-Su Muzhe.
-Ms. Su.

26:55.720 --> 26:57.960
Clear Mind?

26:59.640 --> 27:00.920
Is the shop

27:01.000 --> 27:04.480
going to close?

27:10.880 --> 27:11.760
Mr. Qin.

27:13.520 --> 27:15.480
If you join Clear Mind,

27:15.560 --> 27:16.960
it won't close.

27:18.280 --> 27:19.240
Today,

27:19.760 --> 27:20.800
I'm here

27:22.360 --> 27:23.720
to ask you to work with me.

27:24.280 --> 27:25.560
I want Clear Mind to make glass.

27:26.280 --> 27:27.720
Glass?

27:29.840 --> 27:31.280
Look.

27:31.360 --> 27:33.920
I can't sell

27:34.000 --> 27:37.040
my glass.

27:37.120 --> 27:38.080
Mr. Qin.

27:38.960 --> 27:40.800
We understand you.

27:40.880 --> 27:42.680
It's all because of the Zheng family.

27:42.760 --> 27:45.080
The glass is their featured product.

27:45.160 --> 27:48.200
They don't allow others to make it.

27:48.280 --> 27:49.400
We understand.

27:51.160 --> 27:55.880
I used to be as arrogant

27:56.880 --> 27:59.840
as you were.

27:59.920 --> 28:06.320
The government closed my shop two days
after I opened it.

28:06.960 --> 28:11.600
They framed me for selling toxic glass,

28:12.640 --> 28:13.720
and someone was poisoned by it.

28:13.800 --> 28:18.400
I lost all my money.

28:18.920 --> 28:23.280
They almost beat me to death

28:23.360 --> 28:25.320
before letting me go.

28:26.600 --> 28:28.920
I didn't give up.

28:29.000 --> 28:31.720
I made glass

28:31.800 --> 28:35.360
and sold it from street to street.

28:36.480 --> 28:40.680
You know what?

28:41.560 --> 28:45.800
They smashed my kiln.

28:46.560 --> 28:48.640
I can't hold anything

28:50.800 --> 28:55.120
with this hand.

28:55.200 --> 28:56.400
Mr. Qin.

28:58.640 --> 29:00.560
No matter how dangerous
or difficult it is,

29:02.720 --> 29:04.000
I want to give it a try.

29:05.920 --> 29:08.000
If I sell these

29:09.440 --> 29:10.800
for more than half a million mace,

29:12.000 --> 29:13.160
you work with us, okay?

29:14.200 --> 29:15.320
All right.

29:17.200 --> 29:22.200
If you can sell these goods,

29:22.280 --> 29:26.760
I'll work with you.

29:30.560 --> 29:33.880
Mr. Qin. I'll move these goods.

29:33.960 --> 29:35.440
-Thank you, Mr. Qin.
-Thank you.

29:43.320 --> 29:46.080
Ms. Su, it's all broken.

29:46.160 --> 29:47.040
How can we sell them?

29:52.400 --> 29:53.760
Miss.

29:54.960 --> 29:59.680
You can take back your words.

30:00.600 --> 30:02.080
Baroque pearls are also pearls.

30:02.920 --> 30:04.320
Broken glass is also glass.

30:07.080 --> 30:08.080
Mr. Qin.

30:08.600 --> 30:10.880
Half a million mace. It's a deal.

30:17.480 --> 30:19.400
Zhenlang Pavilion's people, come out.

30:19.920 --> 30:21.240
Come out.

30:23.800 --> 30:25.680
Sir, what can I do for you?

30:25.760 --> 30:26.960
Are you the owner?

30:28.240 --> 30:29.280
Calm down.

30:29.800 --> 30:31.440
You sold me a fake.

30:31.520 --> 30:34.160
We've always sold the real thing.
We don't sell fakes.

30:34.760 --> 30:36.720
Are you mistaken?

30:36.800 --> 30:39.200
Let's talk inside.

30:40.040 --> 30:42.680
We'll talk here.

30:44.000 --> 30:45.040
Take it.

30:48.120 --> 30:50.240
Is it the mark of Zhenlang Pavilion?

30:51.320 --> 30:53.760
Well… The mark is real.

30:53.840 --> 30:54.840
-But this thing…
-Hey.

30:55.360 --> 30:56.640
You admitted it.

30:58.000 --> 31:02.200
Everyone,
Zhenlang Pavilion sold fake stuff.

31:02.280 --> 31:04.320
They passed gold-plated bronze off
as gold.

31:05.200 --> 31:06.400
It's not true.

31:06.480 --> 31:07.800
It's not true.

31:07.880 --> 31:09.760
Stop quibbling. Come on.

31:09.840 --> 31:12.400
Show everyone the one we burned.

31:12.480 --> 31:13.720
Have a look.

31:13.800 --> 31:16.120
-Ladies and gentlemen.
-Zhenlang Pavilion sells fake stuff.

31:16.200 --> 31:17.720
True gold does not fear fire.

31:17.800 --> 31:19.480
Zhenlang Pavilion

31:19.560 --> 31:21.040
deceives people.

31:21.120 --> 31:22.560
They sell fakes.

31:22.640 --> 31:24.280
-Fake.
-Fake.

31:24.360 --> 31:25.800
-Dishonest.
-Listen to me.

31:25.880 --> 31:27.840
-It's not ours.
-Dishonest.

31:27.920 --> 31:29.320
-Listen to me.
-Dishonest.

31:29.400 --> 31:30.960
-It's not ours.
-You sell fakes.

31:31.040 --> 31:32.240
-It's not true.
-Out of the way.

31:32.320 --> 31:33.200
Back off.

31:34.120 --> 31:35.440
Don't make trouble!

31:36.520 --> 31:37.480
Back off.

31:37.560 --> 31:39.160
ZHENLANG PAVILION

31:42.720 --> 31:44.560
-What's going on?
-It's good you're here.

31:45.160 --> 31:47.440
Zhenlang Pavilion sells fakes.

31:47.520 --> 31:49.920
They passed gold-plated bronze off
as gold.

31:50.000 --> 31:51.000
Take a look.

31:51.760 --> 31:53.320
They deceived us.

31:53.400 --> 31:54.960
It's not ours.

31:56.920 --> 31:58.000
-What do you have to say?
-This…

31:58.640 --> 31:59.880
It's not ours.

31:59.960 --> 32:01.680
You said

32:01.760 --> 32:03.320
it was a mark of Zhenlang Pavilion.

32:04.240 --> 32:06.960
Everyone here heard it. Right?

32:07.040 --> 32:08.120
Yes.

32:08.200 --> 32:11.000
-Fraud!
-Fraud!

32:11.080 --> 32:12.400
Silence!

32:13.880 --> 32:15.080
Stop arguing.

32:16.080 --> 32:18.920
Seal Zhenlang Pavilion.

32:19.600 --> 32:21.640
You go with me.

32:22.240 --> 32:23.560
Officer.

32:23.640 --> 32:24.760
My master is out.

32:24.840 --> 32:26.680
Could you please make an exception?

32:26.760 --> 32:29.000
When my master comes back
and finds out the truth,

32:29.080 --> 32:31.640
we will explain it to you
and this gentleman.

32:31.720 --> 32:34.760
Shut up. Or I'll rough you up.

32:34.840 --> 32:38.600
-Arrest him!
-Arrest him!

32:47.840 --> 32:48.680
Mr. Xu.

32:53.640 --> 32:54.680
You may leave.

32:57.040 --> 32:58.680
Mr. Xu, have a seat.

33:10.680 --> 33:11.520
Mr. Xu.

33:13.400 --> 33:14.920
I heard Zhenlang Pavilion sold fakes.

33:16.000 --> 33:18.800
It's under investigation.

33:18.880 --> 33:20.240
The evidence is clear.

33:21.320 --> 33:23.520
Mr. Xu, why don't you give it a push?

33:23.600 --> 33:25.120
We didn't find any other fakes

33:25.920 --> 33:28.040
in Zhenlang Pavilion.

33:29.440 --> 33:32.560
You shouldn't take it seriously.

33:32.640 --> 33:35.120
Zhenlang Pavilion
used to belong to the Cui family.

33:35.200 --> 33:36.640
Mr. Xu, please help me.

33:42.840 --> 33:44.720
Zhenlang Pavilion sold fakes.

33:44.800 --> 33:45.960
Yan Zijing is missing.

33:46.040 --> 33:48.120
If you convict him and auction the shop,

33:48.200 --> 33:50.160
maybe Yan Zijing will show up.

33:50.240 --> 33:53.280
Master Yan usually

33:53.360 --> 33:54.800
respects me.

34:03.080 --> 34:04.360
If you auction Zhenlang Pavilion,

34:05.080 --> 34:06.720
I'm willing to give you

34:06.800 --> 34:08.560
all the jewelry in it.

34:08.639 --> 34:10.000
I only want Zhenlang Pavilion.

34:21.639 --> 34:24.199
Zheng Wu, what do you say?

34:24.280 --> 34:27.360
I agree with Lady Shijiu.

34:29.239 --> 34:30.120
Here's to you.

34:30.199 --> 34:32.239
Lady Shijiu, you're generous.

34:48.600 --> 34:49.480
Take the medicine.

34:50.639 --> 34:51.560
Be careful. It's hot.

34:52.560 --> 34:53.480
Thank you.

34:54.400 --> 34:55.880
How do you have time

34:56.639 --> 34:58.200
to study Go?

35:02.800 --> 35:06.080
-What? Is the show over?
-Yes.

35:06.160 --> 35:08.160
Zhenlang Pavilion is sealed.

35:08.240 --> 35:09.280
You're the owner.

35:10.760 --> 35:11.920
But you don't seem to care at all.

35:16.440 --> 35:17.280
Are you thinking of setting someone up?

35:17.360 --> 35:19.200
What are you talking about?

35:19.280 --> 35:20.720
Look what the Zheng family did to me.

35:20.800 --> 35:23.160
-Can I set someone up?
-Don't pretend to be pathetic.

35:24.360 --> 35:26.240
You've always been like that.

35:27.400 --> 35:28.840
You value profits.

35:28.920 --> 35:30.240
You plan ahead every time.

35:31.720 --> 35:33.240
Am I that good?

35:36.600 --> 35:38.520
You don't have to tell me.

35:40.200 --> 35:43.440
I know all the people who are interested

35:43.520 --> 35:44.920
in Zhenlang Pavilion.

35:50.120 --> 35:51.120
Don't forget

35:52.040 --> 35:54.480
that there is one person who is very calm.

35:55.520 --> 35:57.720
-Who is it?
-What do you think?

36:01.400 --> 36:02.360
Yeah.

36:03.680 --> 36:05.720
Mr. Zhang didn't act.

36:15.520 --> 36:18.000
Tell me. Who's next?

36:20.040 --> 36:21.440
Xu Nanying

36:23.000 --> 36:24.280
is next.

36:24.880 --> 36:26.000
Collusion between government
and businessmen.

36:27.560 --> 36:29.000
Xu Nanying is an official.

36:30.080 --> 36:31.480
The matter in Yangzhou is hard to solve.

36:33.440 --> 36:35.200
You don't want Zhenlang Pavilion.

36:35.280 --> 36:37.280
You might as well burn it

36:37.360 --> 36:39.240
like you burned the Cui's Pearl Farm.

36:40.320 --> 36:42.080
The things
that the Cui family get their hands on

36:43.360 --> 36:44.200
are dirty.

36:51.080 --> 36:52.920
I don't understand

36:54.360 --> 36:56.320
why Prince Ying trusted Xu Nanying

36:57.920 --> 37:00.080
and appointed him

37:00.160 --> 37:01.400
as the Governor of Yangzhou.

37:01.480 --> 37:04.000
Xu Nanying was a man of Prince Tan.

37:04.080 --> 37:05.920
Later, he went to Prince Ying.

37:06.000 --> 37:07.240
It's weird.

37:07.320 --> 37:09.040
If Prince Ying wanted money,

37:12.440 --> 37:14.160
he didn't have to trust Xu Nanying.

37:15.920 --> 37:17.040
Maybe…

37:19.920 --> 37:21.960
Maybe Xu Nanying has something on him.

37:28.920 --> 37:30.480
Xu Lin didn't follow Xu Nanying

37:31.640 --> 37:33.080
to Yangzhou.

37:39.120 --> 37:39.960
It's your turn.

37:47.320 --> 37:50.160
You're in a good mood these days.

37:55.960 --> 37:58.880
You're really generous.

38:01.840 --> 38:03.200
If I didn't do it,

38:03.280 --> 38:05.680
Xu Nanying wouldn't have agreed.

38:06.520 --> 38:07.520
Even if you succeed,

38:07.600 --> 38:10.600
you can only get
an empty Zhenlang Pavilion.

38:10.680 --> 38:11.640
What's the point of that?

38:12.240 --> 38:13.760
I can change
the Black Dragon Bandits' stolen goods

38:14.440 --> 38:17.800
and sell them at Zhenlang Pavilion.

38:17.880 --> 38:20.480
It's also to help the Zheng family.

38:21.080 --> 38:22.000
Have you forgotten

38:23.280 --> 38:25.440
that Zheng Si died on this?

38:26.760 --> 38:27.600
Are you scared?

38:29.440 --> 38:31.520
Zheng Zhixing was stupid.

38:31.600 --> 38:33.360
Lady Huan was noble.

38:33.440 --> 38:34.560
What could they do?

38:40.880 --> 38:41.800
Stop.

38:52.000 --> 38:54.760
BAICAOJING HOUSE

38:58.720 --> 39:00.040
You should learn how to be a woman

39:00.960 --> 39:03.960
instead of a businesswoman.

39:11.400 --> 39:14.240
Zheng Zhiheng and Cui Shijiu
went to Xu Nanying.

39:14.320 --> 39:16.640
Xu Nanying intervened in the case
of Zhenlang Pavilion.

39:17.320 --> 39:19.760
Steward Zhao pretended to betray.

39:19.840 --> 39:21.440
Zhenlang Pavilion

39:22.440 --> 39:23.720
will soon be auctioned.

39:26.480 --> 39:28.000
The more greedy you are,

39:28.720 --> 39:29.720
the sooner you fail.

39:45.800 --> 39:46.800
Cui Shijiu,

39:53.400 --> 39:55.120
Zhenlang Pavilion

39:58.520 --> 39:59.480
is yours now.

39:59.560 --> 40:00.400
CONTRACT

40:10.920 --> 40:11.840
Um…

40:27.320 --> 40:28.280
Wait.

40:30.960 --> 40:32.880
We don't know where Yan Zijing is.

40:34.440 --> 40:36.240
I want to see him alive and dead.

40:37.800 --> 40:39.240
Is he really dead?

40:40.840 --> 40:43.920
Or he's just hiding.

40:45.560 --> 40:46.440
Wait.

40:47.360 --> 40:49.480
It went so smoothly for me
to get Zhenlang Pavilion back.

40:51.960 --> 40:53.120
He went through a lot
to get Zhenlang Pavilion.

40:53.200 --> 40:54.840
Why did he give it up?

40:56.600 --> 40:58.320
Is this a trap?

40:59.400 --> 41:00.680
Are we being deceived?

41:00.760 --> 41:03.680
Shijiu, you care too much
about Yan Zijing.

41:04.280 --> 41:06.760
No one in Yangzhou
can threaten the Zheng family.

41:06.840 --> 41:09.200
And no one can threaten us.

41:13.320 --> 41:14.240
Be happy.

41:14.880 --> 41:16.000
You got Zhenlang Pavilion back.

41:24.280 --> 41:26.480
Zhenlang Pavilion is one
of the important shops of the Cui family.

41:28.720 --> 41:30.600
I took back Zhenlang Pavilion.

41:31.520 --> 41:32.600
I have a chance

41:33.520 --> 41:34.400
to revive the Cui Family.

41:34.480 --> 41:36.240
What are you going to do after that?

41:40.840 --> 41:41.840
Mr. Zheng.

41:41.920 --> 41:43.720
The master asked you to go back
as soon as possible.

41:45.680 --> 41:46.720
Okay.

41:49.240 --> 41:50.240
Don't worry.

41:50.760 --> 41:52.800
I'll keep my word.

42:09.640 --> 42:10.640
Tread carefully.

42:11.360 --> 42:12.480
Don't worry.

42:12.560 --> 42:14.760
I've never made a mistake.

42:16.320 --> 42:18.760
I have a favor to ask you.

42:19.680 --> 42:20.880
Qin Mu is unthoughtful.

42:20.960 --> 42:23.120
He wants to depend on the Zheng family.

42:23.200 --> 42:25.800
But the Zheng family
won't really help him.

42:25.880 --> 42:28.000
I'm worried he might get into trouble.

42:28.080 --> 42:29.000
Baicaojing House…

42:29.080 --> 42:31.000
Please take care of him.

42:31.080 --> 42:33.760
I'll repay you.

42:34.960 --> 42:36.040
-Take whatever you like.
-Mr. Qin.

42:36.120 --> 42:37.360
It's all yours.

42:39.240 --> 42:40.480
Mr. Xu.

42:43.360 --> 42:45.560
-Niao's boyfriend?
-Shut up.

42:45.640 --> 42:46.760
Mr. Qin.
